      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\">Table show alphabet serial number &ndash;</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/12/alphabet.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 119px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">The pattern followed is,</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/611.PNG\" style=\"width: 311px; height: 328px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">All follow the same pattern, except &lsquo;GIEY&rsquo;.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&ldquo;GIEY&rdquo;</span>&nbsp;is the odd one.</p>\n",
