      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "PLH",
          "html": "PLH"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "KGC",
          "html": "KGC"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "ZVR",
          "html": "ZVR"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "TPK",
          "html": "TPK"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6464fa392d1ceb7f98474f61.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\" /></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"\">The logic followed here is:</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"\">Option 1) PLH &rarr; P - 4&nbsp;= L; L - 4&nbsp;= H.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"\">Option 2) KGC &rarr; K - 4&nbsp;= G; G - 4&nbsp;= C.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"\">Option 3) ZVR &rarr; Z - 4&nbsp;= V; V - 4 = R.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option 4) TPK&nbsp;&rarr; T&nbsp;- 4&nbsp;= P; P&nbsp;- 4&nbsp;= L </span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&ne;</span></strong> <strong>K<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">.</span></strong></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 4&quot;</strong>.</span></div>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6464fa392d1ceb7f98474f61.png"
      ],
