      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/Classificiation_letter_ShivrajDhanave_8oct19_15Q_part1_Archana_Hindi_Reviewed_images_archana_D%201.PNG\" style=\"width: 588px; height: 130px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>D(4) + E(5) &rarr; I(9)</p>\n\n<p><strong>K(11) + N(14) &rarr; Y(25) </strong><strong>&ne; </strong><strong>U</strong></p>\n\n<p>M(13) + G(7) &rarr; T(20)</p>\n\n<p>S(19) + G(7) &rarr; Z(26)</p>\n\n<p>Hence, KNU is the correct answer.</p>\n",
