      "solution": "<p>Given below alphabetic table:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage3244.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is described below:</p>\n\n<p>Option 1)</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Heba_Madhuri_22.04.2021_D1.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 31px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Option 2)</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Heba_Madhuri_22.04.2021_D2.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 29px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Option 3)</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Heba_Madhuri_22.04.2021_D3.png\" style=\"width: 178px; height: 28px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Which is wrong. The pattern must be followed as below:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Heba_Madhuri_22.04.2021_D4.png\" style=\"width: 178px; height: 30px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Option 4)</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Heba_Madhuri_22.04.2021_D5.png\" style=\"width: 179px; height: 30px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence <strong>DGQ </strong>is the odd one out.</p>\n",
