      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\">The logic followed here is :-</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/04/6241d4a77072bb650e055a50_16506132400321.png\" style=\"height: 107px; width: 450px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">1)&nbsp;<span style=\"\">DSE - There is at least one vowel i.e &#39;E&#39;.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">2) MMV - There is no vowel.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">3) LPU - There is at least one vowel i.e &#39;U&#39;.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">4) AMU - There are two&nbsp;vowels i.e &#39;A&#39; and &#39;U&#39;.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Thus, Out of the four letter clusters only second option doesn&#39;t have a vowel in it.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Hence, <strong>&quot;MMV&quot;</strong> is the correct answer.</span></p>\n",
