    {
      "id": "f931f7bbd706-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "Three of the following four letter-clusters are alike in a certain way and one is different. Pick the odd one out.",
      "questionHtml": "Three of the following four letter-clusters are alike in a certain way and one is different. Pick the odd one out.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "IMNR",
          "html": "IMNR"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "PTGK",
          "html": "PTGK"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "ORIL",
          "html": "ORIL"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "UYBF",
          "html": "UYBF"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/Alphabets.png\" style=\"width: 536px; height: 128px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The logic follows here is :</p>\n\n<p><b>The first and last terms are reverse to each other.</b></p>\n\n<p><b>The second and third terms are reverse to each other.</b></p>\n\n<p><b>Second term = (First term) + 4.</b></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/F8_Pooja%20Sharma_17-2-2021_Swati_D4.png\" style=\"width: 182px; height: 119px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/F8_Pooja%20Sharma_17-2-2021_Swati_D5.png\" style=\"width: 182px; height: 119px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/F8_Pooja%20Sharma_17-2-2021_Swati_D6.png\" style=\"width: 182px; height: 119px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/F8_Pooja%20Sharma_17-2-2021_Swati_D7.png\" style=\"width: 182px; height: 119px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>ORIL&nbsp;</strong>isn&#39;t following the pattern.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>&quot;ORIL&quot;.</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/important-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Important Points</u></span></strong></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Sum of positional values of reverse letters = 27.</strong></p>\n\n<p>e.g. B (2) + Y (25) = 27.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/Alphabets.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/F8_Pooja%20Sharma_17-2-2021_Swati_D4.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/F8_Pooja%20Sharma_17-2-2021_Swati_D5.png",
