      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/07/alpha.PNG\" style=\"width: 602px; height: 128px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/07/F1_Archana.M_23-07-2020_Savita_D13.png\" style=\"width: 470px; height: 127px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>All follow the same pattern except &ldquo;QSC - GNB&rdquo;</p>\n\n<p>Hence, &ldquo;QSC - GNB&rdquo; is odd among them.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n",
