    {
      "id": "f931f7bbd706-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "Four of the following five are identical in a certain way and hence create a group. Which one is not related to the group? S, Q, C, A, X",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Four of the following five are identical in a certain way and hence create a group. Which one is not related to the group?</p>\n\n<p>S, Q, C, A, X</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "X",
          "html": "X"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "C",
          "html": "C"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "S",
          "html": "S"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Q",
          "html": "Q"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The position and positional values of English Alphabets are:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/08/alpha%20teb%20%281%29.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>The logic followed here is: Considering the place value of each letter given in the series.</p>\n\n<p>&quot;S&quot; is the 19th letter.<br />\n<br />\n&quot;Q&quot; is the 17th letter.<br />\n<br />\n&quot;C&quot; is the 3rd letter.<br />\n<br />\n&quot;A&quot; is the 1st letter.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>&quot;X&quot; is the 24th letter.</strong></p>\n\n<p>Here, the positional value of X is even while other letters have odd place value.</p>\n\n<p>So, <strong>X&nbsp;</strong>is odd among the given letters in the series.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <em><strong>&#39;Option 1&#39;.</strong></em></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/08/alpha%20teb%20%281%29.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    }
